    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d120-a1">

                <pb facs="0213" n="171" xml:id="pg171"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Supposed list of the persons to whom the replies on
                        behalf of the President ought to be addressed.</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Edinburgh.—</hi>John Beaton, secretary of the United
                    Trades Council, chairman.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Paisley, Scotland.</hi>—David Campbell, esq.,
                    chairman.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Luddenden Foot. Halifax.</hi>—Joseph Bottomly,
                    chairman.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Aberdane, South Wales.</hi>—Rev. W. Edwards,
                    chairman.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Oldham, Lancashire.</hi>—Thomas Emmott, esq., chairman,
                    Belmont Terrace, Middleton Road, Oldham.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Merthyr Tydfil, South Wales.</hi>—Charles H. James,
                    chairman.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Carlisle, Cumberland county.</hi>—James Ross,
                    chairman.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Rawtenstall, Lancashire county.</hi>—Peter Ormerod
                    Whitehead, esq., chairman.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
